  "description": "Complete N-Tier architecture generator for .NET 8. Automatically generates DTOs, Validators, Repositories, Services, and Controllers from your entity models. Supports Fluent API for easy configuration. Use 'NetSchema.Configure().AddEntity<T>().GenerateAll()' to generate full CRUD operations.",
