  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.0 - Major Update:\n\t\t\t🚀 NEW: Fluent API for code generation from existing entities\n\t\t\t🚀 NEW: Automatic DTO, Validator, Repository, Service, Controller generation\n\t\t\t🚀 NEW: Smart validation rules based on property types\n\t\t\t🚀 NEW: AutoMapper configuration generation\n\t\t\t🚀 NEW: Dependency Injection auto-registration\n\t\t\t✅ Enhanced: DbContext auto-update with DbSets\n\t\t\t✅ Enhanced: Better error handling and logging\n\t\t\t✅ Complete N-Tier architecture with 5 layers\n\t\t\t✅ Soft delete support with query filters\n\t\t\t✅ Repository pattern with ExistsAsync and CountAsync\n\t\t\t✅ Connection retry strategy and CORS support\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tBreaking Changes:\n\t\t\t- New API: NetSchema.Configure().AddEntity<T>().GenerateAll()\n\t\t\t- Old command: 'dotnet netschema generate' still works for initial setup",
